In the sample code given, the comment "@@@ postion of x in old array is more than or equal to -1" means that after the call to `arrList.Insert(index, x);` is performed, the index of the inserted 'x' in the old array should be no less than -1. This assertion ensures that the 'x' is indeed inserted at an index greater than or equal to -1.--------------------
